{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S09把“怕孤单”进一步推成“甚至愿意再受那些气”，比X更像替人物下了一个尚未充分铺垫的心理判断。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y更好。加亮短语让我能先抓住每段叙事的关键转折，较小的感受词又按照音乐时点出现，不必同时消化一大堆并列标签。它把怀念亲近、害怕孤单、不愿再忍、最终带着想念继续生活的心理因果串得更清楚，同时用具体的音响、节奏和情绪变化让我感受到细腻的过程；X虽然也有不少准确的感受词，但右侧短词经常堆叠，彼此的先后关系和音乐对应时刻不够清楚。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "07475216-e4b6-49bb-8119-b69c11babecc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T005343585141Z", "elapsed_seconds": 43.657, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:54:27.247894+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b7d13ad6aed50a53363394c6d3799018912c57b8bdeec30c8d7daf5f2c5b5723", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py":